## Main objective

Create a DCM-ready group grand mean for the retained healthy-control cohort, using only the **Standard** and **Pitch Deviant** conditions. This is the first practical step of the integrated source reconstruction and DCM modelling stage.

## Inputs

- 19 main healthy-control final averaged files from `/Users/klauskrause/Documents/MATLAB/ds004837_controls_spm`.
- 1 pilot final averaged file from `/Users/klauskrause/Documents/MATLAB/ds004837_spm_test/maflp_fhp_dbe2_sub-2247A_run-01.mat`.
- Total retained group size used today: **20 participants**.
- Final participant-level averaged files had 3 conditions, 200 Hz sampling rate, -100 to 300 ms epoch window, and 102 MEG channels.

## Work completed

### 1. Created a dedicated DCM Day 1 working folder

A new working folder was used for the grand-mean preparation stage:

```text
